[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]人文背景[/font][/b]


汉末乱世中，襄阳成为北方士人南避之所：

[indent]•  [color=#000000]士族家族[/color]：庞（庞德公、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "庞统", "cat": "people"}]庞统[/url][/color]）、黄（黄承彦）、蔡（蔡瑁）、蒯（蒯越、蒯良）、马（[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "马良", "cat": "people"}]马良[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "马谡", "cat": "people"}]马谡[/url][/color]）、习（[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "习祯", "cat": "people"}]习祯[/url][/color]）、杨（[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "杨仪", "cat": "people"}]杨仪[/url][/color]）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]避难名士[/color]：司马徽、王粲、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "宋忠", "cat": "people"}]宋忠[/url][/color]、杜夔等[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
